<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="times new roman, serif" size="4" style="box-sizing: border-box;">Although it appears that we are not going to be able to help you achieve your real estate investing goals at this time, I wanted to say thank you for your interest in our company.</font></div>

