<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="times new roman, serif" size="4" style="box-sizing: border-box;">I also want to invite you to follow our company&#39;s blog at&nbsp;<a href="http://blog.memphisinvest.com/" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: none; background-color: transparent;" target="_blank">http://blog.memphisinvest.<wbr style="box-sizing: border-box;" />com/</a>&nbsp;where Chris Clothier, one of our owners, shares news about our company, our industry, and other topics relevant to real estate investors almost daily.</font></div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</div>

<div style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="times new roman, serif" size="4" style="box-sizing: border-box;">Many of our current clients first spoke to us 1-2 years before they were in a position to start building a portfolio, so please keep my contact information listed below so that you can reach out to me in the future! &nbsp;</font></div>

